# NVIDIA's DLSS SDK is not redistributable: download it yourself (addons/LSP-NeuralRender/external/ngx/README.md)
addons/LSP-NeuralRender/external/ngx/*
!addons/LSP-NeuralRender/external/ngx/README.md
# anything else dropped into external/ (SDK drops, snippets) stays out of the repo
addons/LSP-NeuralRender/external/*
!addons/LSP-NeuralRender/external/ngx/
